The review has been written to `docs/reviews/defaults-data/defdata-04-water-heating-defaults.md`.

**Key findings summary:**
- **8 findings** (0 critical, 2 high, 4 medium, 2 low)
- **High**: `default_paramters.csv` is critically incomplete — missing tank volumes, UA values, UEF ratings, recovery efficiencies; only has 4 stub parameters with empty units
- **High**: Draw schedule uses the DOE UEF test procedure pattern (midnight-dominant, ~24h uniform) rather than occupancy-based residential profile (6-9 AM / 5-9 PM peaks)
- **Medium**: Schedule file misnamed "UEF" — contains draw profile, not efficiency values; daily draw 208 L vs ASHRAE 240 L target; missing units on all parameters; 49°C setpoint is at Legionella minimum
- **Low**: Filename typo "paramters"; no weekday/weekend schedule differentiation
